# Android / Gradle local state.
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/.cxx/
**/captures/
**/key.properties

# Node dependencies and debug logs.
**/node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

